---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import AssistanceControl from '../components/AssistanceControl.astro';
import {questions} from '../lib/spec.mjs';
import AppSettings from '../components/AppSettings.astro';
import InitReadiness from '../components/InitReadiness.astro';
---
<Base title="Init: make it yours" description="Configure independent mini-apps and export one portable specification with a complete copy-to-Codex handoff."><div class="init-heading"><h1>Give your app some shape.</h1><p class="lede">Your agent prepares the environment in <a href="/ready">Get Ready</a>, then uses this specification to build and deploy. Edit the fields, preview the result and take the portable specification to your agent. Save a draft on this device or download it to keep a portable copy.</p></div><AssistanceControl/><InitReadiness/><p class="content-model-entry">Need your own content types and fields? <a href="/init/content">Design an EmDash content model and try its form.</a></p><section class="init-recommendation" data-init-recommendation><div><h2>What should the app do?</h2><label>Your goal<select data-recommendation-goal disabled>{questions.find(q=>q.id==='goal')!.options.map(([id,label])=><option value={id}>{label}</option>)}</select></label><p data-recommendation-reason></p><p data-recommendation-limit class="small"></p><p data-assistance-guided class="small">Choose the outcome first. Your agent owns the technical setup. You can inspect another starting point before applying it; title, introduction, appearance, address and shared app settings are preserved where they apply.</p><details data-assistance-detail><summary>Apps and source contracts</summary><div data-recommendation-sources></div></details></div><div class="recommendation-visual"><p class="preview-caption">Recommendation preview · fictional content</p><div data-recommendation-preview></div></div><div class="recommendation-actions"><button data-recommendation-use type="button" disabled>Use this starting point</button><p data-recommendation-message role="status" aria-live="polite"></p></div></section><section class="draft-toolbar" aria-label="Draft actions"><div><strong id="draft-status" role="status" aria-live="polite">New draft · not saved yet</strong><p class="small">Saving keeps this draft in this browser. Download a spec to move it elsewhere.</p><p id="validation-message" class="small" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p></div><button type="submit" form="init-form" id="save-draft">Save draft</button></section><section id="import-review" class="import-review" hidden tabindex="-1" aria-labelledby="import-heading"><h2 id="import-heading">Review the imported draft</h2><p id="import-summary"></p><p class="small">Replacing changes the form. Your saved draft stays intact until you choose Save draft.</p><div class="actions"><button type="button" id="replace-import">Replace current draft</button><button type="button" id="cancel-import" class="secondary">Keep current draft</button></div></section><div class="workbench init-workspace"><form id="init-form" aria-describedby="validation-message"><fieldset><legend>Your starting point</legend><label>Apps<select name="preset"><option value="composition">Guestbook + Showcase</option><option value="guestbook">Photo Guestbook</option><option value="showcase">Curated Showcase</option><option value="hello">Hello World reference</option></select></label><label>Title<input name="title" required maxlength="80" value="Our corner"/></label><label>Introduction<textarea name="intro" maxlength="240">A shared collection of moments worth keeping.</textarea></label></fieldset><fieldset><legend>Appearance</legend><label>Theme<select name="theme"><option value="daylight">Daylight</option><option value="midnight">Midnight</option></select></label><label id="layout-label">Layout<select name="layout"><option value="grid">Gallery grid</option><option value="editorial">Larger editorial images</option></select></label></fieldset><AppSettings/><fieldset id="privacy"><legend>Publication</legend><p>Submitted photos stay private until the owner approves them. Hiding a contribution removes its controlled media and featured cards.</p><span class="badge">Review first · supported safe default</span></fieldset><fieldset id="cards-field"><legend>Your curated links</legend><p class="small">Give each card a title and an HTTPS link. Remove an unfinished card to leave it out. Connected galleries supply featured photos.</p><div id="card-rows"></div><button type="button" class="secondary" id="add-card">Add a card</button></fieldset><fieldset><legend>Deployment intent</legend><label>Destination<select name="target"><option value="preview">A temporary Cloudflare address</option><option value="existing-domain">An existing domain</option><option value="new-domain">Explore a new domain</option></select></label><label id="hostname-label" hidden>Hostname<input name="hostname" placeholder="app.example.com" maxlength="253"/></label><p id="target-help" class="small">The agent verifies the actual account and toolchain before deployment.</p></fieldset><div class="actions"><button type="submit">Save draft</button><button type="button" id="reset" class="secondary">Start a fresh draft</button></div><label>Import a saved spec<input id="import" type="file" accept="application/json"/></label><p role="status" aria-live="polite" id="message" class="message"></p></form><aside class="sticky" aria-label="Draft preview and export"><div class="actions"><button id="download" class="secondary">Download spec</button><button id="copy">Copy to Codex</button></div><div class="app-layout-preview" data-layout-preview><div class="preview-caption" id="preview-caption">Layout preview · sample content</div><div data-app-layout></div></div><div class="ink preview-detail"><h2 id="preview-title">Our corner</h2><p id="preview-intro" class="lede">A shared collection of moments worth keeping.</p><p id="preview-apps">Guestbook + Showcase</p><div id="preview-settings"></div><p class="small" id="preset-story">Here / there collects and reviews the photos. Top shelf gives approved moments and curated links a place together.</p></div><details data-assistance-detail><summary>Portable specification</summary><pre id="spec"></pre></details><details data-assistance-detail><summary>Read the agent handoff</summary><pre id="prompt" tabindex="-1"></pre></details><p class="small">No credentials go into this spec. A copied prompt is a handoff, not proof that an agent executed it.</p></aside></div><script src="../lib/init-client.ts"></script></Base>

<style>
 .draft-toolbar{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px;border-block:1px solid var(--color-border);padding:20px 0;margin-bottom:24px}.draft-toolbar p{margin:6px 0 0}.draft-toolbar strong{font-size:1rem}.draft-toolbar button{flex-shrink:0}.import-review{padding:24px;background:var(--color-surface);border:1px solid var(--color-border);border-radius:12px;margin-bottom:28px}.import-review h2{font-size:1.5rem;max-width:none;margin-bottom:16px}.import-review p{overflow-wrap:anywhere}.import-review .actions{margin-bottom:0}.init-workspace button:disabled,.draft-toolbar button:disabled{cursor:not-allowed}#validation-message:empty{display:none}
 .init-recommendation{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1fr);grid-template-areas:"choices preview" "actions preview";gap:0 48px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-border);padding:24px 0 40px;margin-bottom:32px}.init-recommendation>div:first-child{grid-area:choices}.recommendation-visual{grid-area:preview}.recommendation-actions{grid-area:actions;align-self:start}.init-recommendation h2{font-size:1.7rem;max-width:none}.init-recommendation :global(pre){font-size:12px;max-height:260px}.init-recommendation button{margin-top:20px}.init-recommendation>div{min-width:0}.init-recommendation :global(code){overflow-wrap:anywhere}.init-heading h1{font-size:3rem;max-width:26ch;margin-top:0}.init-heading .lede{font-size:1.1rem;max-width:76ch}.init-workspace{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.1fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:48px}.app-layout-preview{background:var(--color-surface);border-radius:10px;padding:16px;border:1px solid var(--color-border);margin-top:24px}.preview-caption{font-size:12px;color:var(--color-muted);margin-bottom:14px}.preview-detail{margin-top:20px;padding:22px}.preview-detail h2{font-size:1.7rem}.preview-detail :global(h3){font-size:1.1rem;margin:18px 0 8px}.preview-detail :global(p){font-size:14px}.init-workspace :global(fieldset){padding:20px}.init-workspace :global(legend){font-size:15px}
 @media(max-width:900px){.draft-toolbar{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column;gap:16px}.init-recommendation{grid-template-columns:1fr;grid-template-areas:"choices" "preview" "actions";gap:24px}.init-workspace{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:24px}.init-workspace>aside{position:static}.init-heading h1{font-size:2.3rem}.app-layout-preview{margin-top:0}}
</style>
<style is:global>
 .sample-handle{font-size:13px;margin:-4px 0 12px}.sample-social{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:14px}
 .sample-app{background:#f7f5ef;color:#263d32;padding:22px;border-radius:6px;margin-bottom:16px;overflow:hidden}.sample-app:last-child{margin-bottom:0}.sample-app[data-theme=midnight]{background:#17181b;color:#f2f3f5}.sample-app .sample-brand{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.03em;margin-bottom:16px;opacity:.8}.sample-app h3{font-size:1.6rem;letter-spacing:-.025em;margin:0 0 12px;max-width:none;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.sample-app>p{font-size:13px;line-height:1.55;margin:0 0 20px;white-space:pre-line;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.sample-photos{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px}.sample-photos.editorial{grid-template-columns:1fr}.sample-photos figure{min-width:0}.sample-photos img{display:block;width:100%;height:160px;aspect-ratio:4/3;object-fit:cover;border-radius:4px}.sample-photos figcaption{font-size:11px;padding-top:8px}.sample-link{display:block;border-top:1px solid currentColor;padding:10px 0;font-size:13px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.sample-app .sample-kind{font-size:11px;margin-top:12px;opacity:.8}.sample-hello{min-height:170px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center}
</style>
